For the conversion of abundance into occupancy, psi = 1 - exp(-
lambda).

Regarding goodness-of-fit testing, I know Dan Linden has developed some
code to do goodness of fit testing on Royle-Nichols models. He shared
some code to include in AICcmodavg, but haven't yet added it
unfortunately. Seeing that it has come up a few times on the list, I'll
move it up on my to do list for the next version.

Best,

Marc
